{"name": "Reshine", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take apart, clean and bring new life to long forgotten objects in Reshine - a cozy restoration game that will take you on a journey through history, all within the safe space of your own attic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reshine is a chill, relaxing experience. Simple and intuitive controls, minimalistic UI, straightforward gameplay. There are no complicated systems, no management, no stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/bfb54212056424529a190079af1f23ef.poster.avif?t=1792477937\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/bfb54212056424529a190079af1f23ef.webm?t=1792477937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/bfb54212056424529a190079af1f23ef.mp4?t=1792477937\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/915732bb4ea7773b765263707b850054.avif?t=1792477937\" width=\"392\"/></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Listen to the rainfall, as you slowly work in a quiet attic, where the time seems to have stopped. Surrounded by relics of the past, take apart each object piece by piece. There\u2019s no rush, you can follow your own rhythm, discovering how everything fits together as you go. With nothing to get wrong, you\u2019re free to simply unwind and enjoy the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/5ebd8e616dcb39453f636c20f6510796.poster.avif?t=1792477937\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/5ebd8e616dcb39453f636c20f6510796.webm?t=1792477937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/5ebd8e616dcb39453f636c20f6510796.mp4?t=1792477937\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/331a679d14ad80b015be24e5e8301503.avif?t=1792477937\" width=\"392\"/></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The parts need to be restored to their former glory. Clean away the dust, sand down rough edges, and gently remove the rust using a variety of tools. Pick colors that feel right for you and repaint the surface until it looks good as new. Go in any order you want and just sit back, relax and watch the object come back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/9e2b96b984656b51e17422c5ae779dbc.poster.avif?t=1792477937\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/9e2b96b984656b51e17422c5ae779dbc.webm?t=1792477937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/9e2b96b984656b51e17422c5ae779dbc.mp4?t=1792477937\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/3fa4ed330714c2076958a8a1eec6e955.avif?t=1792477937\" width=\"430\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When every part looks like new, you can slowly bring everything back together. Piece by piece, watch the object take shape again. Before you know it, it\u2019s looking like its old self again, or maybe even better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/9fcaf50e890cdc1200a31026e7d248a6.poster.avif?t=1792477937\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/9fcaf50e890cdc1200a31026e7d248a6.webm?t=1792477937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/9fcaf50e890cdc1200a31026e7d248a6.mp4?t=1792477937\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/61629407a09c94defd83b40217f24f9b.avif?t=1792477937\" width=\"430\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And that's it! Compare your final result with the object before restoration to see how much it has changed. You can repeat the restoration as many times as you want, to try different colors or just relive the experience. But, most importantly, more old treasures await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"584\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/60cc65e77e1845262bb182e5809c2909.poster.avif?t=1792477937\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/60cc65e77e1845262bb182e5809c2909.webm?t=1792477937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/extras/60cc65e77e1845262bb182e5809c2909.mp4?t=1792477937\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Gently restore old objects by cleaning away layers of dust, rust, and time. Reshine is a minimalistic, relaxing experience: use a range of tools to watch years of grime disappear before your eyes. No management, no pressure - just you and the satisfaction of bringing vintage treasures back to life.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4253570/09f1d7876ba9b84e031efff07154f690851e9ce6/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1792477937", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Casual", "Indie", "Cleaning", "Retro", "Relaxing", "Singleplayer"], "developers": "Quite OK Games", "publishers": "Quite OK Games", "release_date": "Nov 26, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4253570", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "19 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Ty9PwsVL0j0", "first_seen": 1792360800.0, "review_rank": 34}